# sidebar-scroll-hover (fix-viewer-size phase 2): the pointer on a's value
# box at its scrolled place, so the hover follows the scroll. The wheel of
# 300 puts the box at (278, 225.5) 107 x 32 (the reference's own DOM), and
# the box's hover look (the ring) and cursor follow it. The plane's cursor
# rule does not reach here (the box is not the plane).
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 216 400
wheel 0 300
wait 1000
move 331.5 241.5
wait 500
shot sidebar-scroll-hover
